<title>BELGIUM: EU says clears Sidmar buy of Flachform Stahl AG.</title>
<headline>EU says clears Sidmar buy of Flachform Stahl AG.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Thursday it had cleared the purchase by Sidmar NV of Flachform Stahl AG &amp; Co and some connected businesses of Kloeckner Stahl und Metallhandel GmbH.</p>
<p>The EU executive issued the news in a statement which contained no further details.</p>
<p>Kloeckner is linked to German industrial group VIAG AG.</p>
<p>Sidmar is a unit of Luxembourg's Arbed.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
